    "answer": "This image features a vibrant green parrot perched on a dark, textured branch. The bird has bright green plumage covering most of its body, contrasting with a noticeable orange coloration on its beak. Its eye is dark and alert, giving it an intelligent expression. The parrot is positioned in profile, allowing a clear view of its head and body structure. The background is a soft, muted green, which helps the bright colors of the bird stand out prominently. The lighting appears natural, highlighting the texture of the feathers and the wood of the branch.",
